== Release ==

=== Broadcast ===
''Agent Carter'' aired on [[American Broadcasting Company|ABC]] in the United States,<ref name="PremiereSynopsis" /> in [[720p]] [[High-definition television|high definition]] and [[5.1 surround sound]].<ref name="Picture/Audio" /> It also aired on [[CTV Television Network|CTV]] in Canada, and [[TV2 (New Zealand)|TV2]] in New Zealand.<ref name="Canada" /><ref name="NZ" /> In October 2014, [[Channel 4]], the channel that airs ''Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.'' in the United Kingdom, stated that they did not "have any current plans [to air] ''Agent Carter''".<ref name="C4NoPlans" /> In June 2015, [[Fox (UK and Ireland)|FOX UK]] purchased the broadcast rights for the United Kingdom,<ref name="FOXUK" /> with the series premiering on July 12, 2015.<ref name="FOXUKDate" /> In February 2016, the series was announced to air on [[7flix]] in Australia.<ref name="Australia" />

